wr2bxebtewm6tswhc","owner":{"kind":"page","pageId":"page_teyen9zyv63gwppbsgsqkkb5mc"},"type":"rich_text","value":{"content":[{"attrs":{"level":1},"content":[{"text":"We start with people,","type":"text"},{"type":"hard_break"},{"marks":[{"type":"italic"}],"text":"not placements.","type":"text"}],"type":"heading"}],"type":"doc"}},{"fieldId":"field_pfabga8rrgvspmye7k3nr7y2y0","owner":{"kind":"page","pageId":"page_teyen9zyv63gwppbsgsqkkb5mc"},"type":"plain_text","value":"Most advertising reaches people mid-scroll, mid-commute, or mid-skip. All Points Media places brands inside the environments where audiences are already present — gyms, medical waiting rooms, golf courses, restaurants, community centers — during the moments that matter, when people are present, relaxed, and ready to engage."},{"fieldId":"field_knr1zv9skdzmypkgffzsykctzg","owner":{"kind":"page","pageId":"page_teyen9zyv63gwppbsgsqkkb5mc"},"type":"plain_text","value":"Our Story"},{"fieldId":"field_fvdfmqxnbmw5mk3e0v800e313w","owner":{"kind":"page","pageId":"page_teyen9zyv63gwppbsgsqkkb5mc"},"type":"plain_text","value":"Darrell McSmith launched All Points Media in 1995 on a simple idea: location is the message. Powerful campaigns don’t interrupt people — they meet them. Rather than highway billboards or skippable screens, APM went after the moments when people are unhurried and receptive."},{"fieldId":"field_se5ecz8xvqn1ybzkh86kaccd4r","owner":{"kind":"page","pageId":"page_teyen9zyv63gwppbsgsqkkb5mc"},"type":"plain_text","value":"The company grew by building what it needed. McSmith invented the AdVan mobile billboard in 2001. APM PrintWorks launched in 2009 to bring production in house. AP Installations followed for field deployment, and APM Digital added the Atlantic City Smart Boardwalk — 50 LED structures reaching 130M+ annual visitors."},{"fieldId":"field_d8xpe9shvv8ztc9zkvspghkfng","owner":{"kind":"page","pageId":"page_teyen9zyv63gwppbsgsqkkb5mc"},"type":"plain_text","value":"The Operating System"},{"f