 photograph is a real All Points Media placement, taken on site — the rooms somebody agreed to let us walk into."},{"fieldId":"field_phmbcpgtsme0nsq6hf4scsrsw4","owner":{"kind":"page","pageId":"page_teyen9zyv63gwppbsgsqkkb5mc"},"type":"plain_text","value":"About — We Start With People, Not Placements — All Points Media"},{"fieldId":"field_mz41tscfj22j2axd772yfkfp0c","owner":{"kind":"page","pageId":"page_teyen9zyv63gwppbsgsqkkb5mc"},"type":"plain_text","value":"An audience-first activation partner — we find where your audience is, build the right network, activate the campaign, execute reliably, and measure results."},{"fieldId":"field_yzkbw6kfpwtx06w1q0ekd7v2yw","owner":{"kind":"page","pageId":"page_4d55wdpg80nwt0x1sv8h30beeg"},"type":"plain_text","value":"Newsletter PDFs — All Points Media"},{"fieldId":"field_9773p6wekrkgdjt6xdhqw4awpg","owner":{"kind":"page","pageId":"page_4d55wdpg80nwt0x1sv8h30beeg"},"type":"plain_text","value":"All Points Media helps brands, agencies, government, and healthcare reach and activate real-world audiences through custom networks, experiential engagement, and national execution."},{"fieldId":"field_hbdw04cj6f53ny3f94qhmvx114","owner":{"kind":"site"},"type":"internal_protected","value":"All Points Co.","valueType":"string"},{"fieldId":"field_gd2ezbdrfbre3jy4df6bmbstx0","owner":{"kind":"site"},"type":"internal_protected","value":"All Points Media","valueType":"string"},{"fieldId":"field_qga9ndnh6tcbcfq9hmzseta2k0","owner":{"kind":"site"},"type":"internal_protected","value":"+15036260669","valueType":"string"},{"fieldId":"field_nt5dgr19sfpzzy4s0w3z1pantm","owner":{"kind":"site"},"type":"internal_protected","value":"sales@allpointsco.com","valueType":"string"},{"fieldId":"field_mgf9a7caxr3hjwsfg0xzt1d3s4","owner":{"kind":"site"},"type":"internal_protected","value":["https://www.allpointsco.com/"],"valueType":"string_list"},{"fieldId":"field_z2pfyzj339kfqbcj9qhjwxpmkg","owner":{"kind":"site"},"type":"internal_protected","value":"All Points